      "title": "The map",
      "subtitle": "k3s, and what it ships in one binary",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Last time we covered the big idea; now let's look at the cluster this series actually runs on."
        },
        {
          "text": "It's k3s: a complete, certified Kubernetes, packed into a single binary of under a hundred megabytes.",
          "pauseAfter": 0.4
        }
